  data: {
    LLM: "Use the seventh card to remove a rank that doesn't fit into a pair or sequence. With 7 cards, you should aim for at least two Flushes or one strong Run.\n\nThe 'Sacrifice' Discard: If you have a choice between making one almost-unbeatable Prial or two very strong Runs, the two Runs are often statistically safer for winning multi-hand comparisons.\n\nKicker Optimization: When building your two hands, ensure Hand B (the weaker hand) has the highest possible kickers. Many rounds are won on Hand B tie-breakers.",
